{
  "app_id": 2950410,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Tactical Auto-Battler Plan your strategy, position your heroes, and watch spectacular chaotic battles unfold automatically. Recruit Historical Figures Use your time machine to bring iconic characters from history into battle. Each character has unique perks, and stacking the right combinations creates devastating team synergies. Gear Up Your Squad Visit shops along your journey to buy upgrades and equip your heroes with gear that shapes their power and playstyle. Multiplayer Co-op Team up with up to two friends and outsmart your foes together. Trade equipment, optimize each other’s builds, and unleash devastating tactical combos against escalating threats. Time Traveling Voyage Journey through time, visiting Ancient Egypt, the Italian Renaissance, and other extraordinary places. Upgrade Your HQ After each mission, upgrade your headquarters to expand your roster, develop cutting-edge gadgets, and enhance your team’s capabilities for the next challenge. Save the World Face the ultimate showdown: a final battle to save humanity from monstrous invaders in this epic last stand."
  },
